{"id": "DcllmSNv_Bk", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"SKILL\" to get Nvidia SkillSpector to protect your Claude Code from getting hacked. \n\nIf you use Claude Code with multiple skills and plugins installed, your PC might already be at risk.\n\nA recent study found that 26% of AI skills contain security vulnerabilities.\n\nAnd 5% actually have malicious stuff inside them.\n\nSo to fix this, NVIDIA built a free AI tool called SkillSpector.\n\nIt basically acts like an antivirus sitting between your Claude Code and the agent skills you're about to install.\n\nYou just point it at any skill, repo, or zip file.\n\nIt scans for security risks like prompt injection, data leaks, and tool misuse.\n\nThen it hands you a risk score out of 100.\n\nSo you know in seconds whether it's safe or not.\n\nThink of it like a bouncer checking IDs before anything gets into your system.\n\nAnd the best part? It's 100% free, open source, and works perfectly with Claude Code and Codex.\n\nIt even works with Gemini CLI too, if you're running that alongside your other tools.\n\n#nvidiaai #vibecoding #claudecode #aisecurity #skillspector ", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1787927717, "like_count": 4237, "comment_count": 3578, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2278460949597862a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 64.794, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPA4hVn_Rv2u9XUX05Er-7j2Wt7l7HHNaojupG4Ltu1svsTkXdi4FIuztaNR8aXRcNwvtFiyAr_6Zph_rNxk2qDNlHv4MvugWto1HM.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=AdpavaiVS7xoyZSx-nCeKaI2P2ehzL_1ROuOybej8EF7Fo0WNwW1jbjU9sne2YDuMAU&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=vyVohXsv35AQ7kNvwGWJW9y&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=m8jZaeZwm2bBDONVU8OxeQ&_nc_ss=70a8c&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&